sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser (api.ts)
  participant M as Starlette router + GZip
  participant H as optimise_endpoint
  participant S as Store
  participant P as run_pipeline (thread pool)
  participant E as Error handlers
  B->>M: POST /api/optimise {capacity, depot}
  M->>H: dispatch to route
  H->>H: body parsed and OptimiseRequest validated
  alt invalid field value (e.g. capacity < 0)
    H-->>E: ValidationError
    E-->>B: {"error": {code, message, details}} 422
  else valid request
    H->>S: update_settings(capacity / depot) [write]
    H->>P: run_in_threadpool(optimise)
    P->>S: parcels(), graph_data(), settings() [reads]
    P->>P: validate, reachability, sort, knapsack, route, ETA
    P->>S: set_result("last_result") [write]
    P-->>H: result dict
    H-->>B: 200 JSON result
  end
  Note over M,E: AlgorithmError subclasses map to 404 / 413 / 422.<br/>Any other exception, including malformed JSON on this route,<br/>maps to 500 internal_error (see finding F-04)
